sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch12-06> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-06--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-06--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch12-06: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.56" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.558"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.66"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Relative chamber size through ontogeny is measurable on sectioned and scanned tests, and the fusulinid landmark file is already organized by whorl. The explanatory half of the claim equates that geometric series with mass-proportional growth of a homogeneous body, which shell outlines cannot separate from other constant-ratio mechanisms. The pattern is therefore testable on a subset of chambered forms, and the stated cause is not." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Compute chamber or whorl volume ratios along individual ontogenies and test constancy against a model in which the ratio itself changes with age. A stable ratio matches the geometric pattern; it confirms growth proportional to existing mass only if protoplasmic mass is measured independently and scales with the same constant, which existing hard-part series do not provide." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "A constant size ratio is also produced by other rules, including a fixed volume added in proportion to surface or a fixed developmental schedule.", "Living mass at the moment each chamber is added is not in the morphometric archives." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch12-06--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch12-06--grok--dataset-2> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-06--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch12-06 by Grok 4.7: 0.62" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.62"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-06--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch12-06> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-06--grok--operationalizability> .
